<title>UK: Housing NZ sets $200 million seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Housing NZ sets $200 million seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers  CSFB and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSING NEW ZEALAND</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    14.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.658    PAY DATE    14.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    99.658    SPREAD	+38 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.5	SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
